            <ArticleTitle>[Psychosomatic mechanism in pathogenesis bronchial asthma and ulcerous disease].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>78-81</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The objective of this article was to study individual capabilities of intrapsychic processing psycho-traumatic events and their impact on somatic health. Clinical characteristics of bronchial asthma patients and those with ulcerous disease were compared. General pathological background for development of psihosomatic pathology was identified.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
